      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Dragonscale Hills [zone=539]\n**Who:**\n- Aring [ _Supplier_]\n- Jashy [ _Supplier_]\n- Tonas [ _Supplier_]\n- Vesiss [ _Supplier_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 80\n**Maximum Level:** | 130\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n**Quest Items:**\n- Clear Crystal [item=70791]\n- Clear Crystal Base [item=70059]\n- Cloudy Crystal [item=71063]\n- Cloudy Crystal Base [item=70806]\n- Essence of Arcana [item=71218]\n- Essence of Decay [item=70795]\n- Essence of Fire [item=71084]\n- Essence of Icicles [item=71083]\n- Essence of Life [item=70520]\n- Essence of Mana [item=71195]\n- Essence of Rage [item=71054]\n- Essence of Sadness [item=71196]\n- Essence of Thunder [item=70846]\n- Essence of Water [item=71062]\n- Glowing Crystal [item=71086]\n- Glowing Crystal Base [item=70902]\n- Light Blue Crystal [item=71198]\n- Light Blue Crystal Base [item=70928]\n- Master Crystal Base [item=71036]\n- Oil Stained Crystal [item=73232]\n- Prismatic Crystal Charm [item=71035]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Crystallos, Lair of the Awakened [zone=540]\n- Crystallos: Raid Instance [zone=573]\n- Dragonscale Hills [zone=539]\n- Hills of Shade [zone=531]\n- Loping Plains [zone=529]\n- Meldrath's Majestic Mansion [zone=535]\n- Meldrath's Mansion: Raid Instance [zone=557]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Glacian [npc=27509]\n- Laiyken [npc=26868]\n- Leaudevie [npc=27508]\n- Pedurrutharenafarokidon [npc=27504]\n- Searzar [npc=27513]\n- The Furyfire [npc=27506]\n- The Prancer of Pain [npc=27510]\n- The Wheel of Fists [npc=27511]\n- Thistlethought [npc=27512]\n- Thundarrak [npc=27507]\n- a chest - Meldrath the Malignant [npc=28067]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Exploring Crystallos [quest=4385]\n- Mansion Event: Meldrath the Malignant [quest=4485]\n- Our Lost Brother - A Clear Crystal [quest=4372]\n- Our Lost Brother - A Cloudy Crystal [quest=4373]\n- Our Lost Brother - A Glowing Crystal [quest=4374]\n- Our Lost Brother - A Light Blue Crystal [quest=4375]\n- Our Lost Brother - Find the Container I [quest=4365]\n- Our Lost Brother - Find the Container II [quest=4366]\n- Our Lost Brother - Find the Container III [quest=4367]\n- Our Lost Brother - Find the Container IV [quest=4368]\n- Raid Expedition: Crystallos, Lair of the Awakened [quest=4528]\n- Raid Expedition: Meldrath's Majestic Mansion [quest=4405]\n- The Search for the Ultimate Story (Meldrath Mansion Access) [quest=4344]\n**Era:** | !Secrets of Faydwer\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Nov 27 18:35:50 2007\nModified: Fri Jul 24 09:07:49 2026 | | _**This task must be completed in order to access the Crystallos, Lair of the Awakened [zone=540] (group) and Crystallos: Raid Instance [zone=573] zones. To finish it, you also need access to the non-instanced Meldrath's Majestic Mansion zone, granted midway through this task [quest=4344].**_\n_**For locations related to this task, see these maps:**_\n\n_**'Beyond the Barrier' is the main task. Make sure to activate it before picking up containers or doing any combines. It's obtained by speaking with one of the four siblings involved; all of whom are located in the Dragonscale Hills:**_\n_**- Aring: /waypoint -22, +1816, +177 (southwest area, near the minotaurs)**_\n\n_**- Jashy: /waypoint +180, +380, +175 (central area, north of the steeds)**_\n\n_**- Tonas: /waypoint +2200, -50 (central northern part)**_\n\n_**- Vesiss: /waypoint +1855, +2275, +128 (northwest of the fairy tower)**_\n_**Each NPC has the same dialogue.**_\n\n---\n\nYou say, 'Hail, Tonas'\nTonas says 'Greetings \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. I pray that your days are [ **brighter**] than mine, and I wish you well.'\nYou say, 'Brighter?'\nTonas says 'My heart is heavy with worry. I am here in these hills searching with my siblings for our lost brother. Our brother has always been rash and after a falling out with the rest of us he made his way here, alone. We have come to [ **search**] for him for we fear what would happen if we did not.'\nYou say, 'Search?'\nTonas says 'My siblings and I all have a certain affinity for each other, one that is subtly magical in nature. No matter the distance we can always find each other. Or at least that was true until very recently, in the case of our brother. We sensed that he entered a stretch of hills in this area but he [ **vanished**] from our sight sometime after. I cannot express to you the worry that this has caused us.'\nYou say, 'Vanished?!'\nTonas says 'In the south eastern area of this region there are strange prismatic hills of unknown origin. A strange substance has taken root there and pools of still prismatic liquid have collected in various locations. Beyond these hills is a barrier that we are unable to pass. It is our belief that our brother has somehow moved past this barrier and is [ **lost**] to us now.'\nYou say, 'Lost?'\nTonas says 'Try as we might, my siblings and I are not strong enough to pierce this barrier, although we have divined a way that another might accomplish this feat, if that individual was stronger than we. Would you [ **dare**] to try?'\nYou say, 'I'll dare'\nTonas says 'Excellent! To succeed you will need to assemble a ward that should provide you with the means to move beyond the barrier in the Prismatic Hills. Come, I will show you one of the small tasks you must perform to accomplish this feat. My siblings and I will each have such a task for you and when you have accomplished each the deed will be done. I beg of you to find our brother and bring back word of his health!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Beyond the Barrier'.\n_**You are also assigned to one of the 'Our Lost Brother - Find the Container' tasks.**_\nLocate Tonas and help him with the task of obtaining the crystal base. Locate Vesiss and help him with the task of obtaining the crystal base. Locate Jashy and help him with the task of obtaining the crystal base. Locate Aring and help him with the task of obtaining the crystal base.\n\n---\n\n**Help Tonas by obtaining the Clear Crystal Base - 0/1 - Dragonscale Hills**\n_**This step updates when you pick up a 'Clear Crystal Base', a container ground spawn in Falrazim's cave in the Dragonscale Hills, marked on this map as 'Clear Crystal Base'.**_\n_**If you do not have the task Our Lost Brother - Find the Container I [quest=4365] from Tonas, you can get it by saying the keyword \"dare\". While you MUST pick up the container, the sub-task itself isn't actually required for Crystallos access. It is only necessary to spawn some named golems later on.**_\n_**You receive Clear Crystal Base [item=70059].**_\n\n---\n\n**Help Vesiss by obtaining the Cloudy Crystal Base - 0/1 - Loping Plains**\n_**This step updates when you pick up a Cloudy Crystal Base, a container groundspawn in the Loping Plains, marked on this map at /waypoint -100, -2704, 335 in a minotaur cave - entered along the steep cliffs just west of the Steamfont Mountains zone).**_\n_**If you do not have the task Our Lost Brother - Find the Container II [quest=4366] from Vesiss, you can get it by saying the keyword \"dare\". Again, while you MUST pick up the container, the sub-task itself is not required.**_\n_**You receive Cloudy Crystal Base [item=70806].**_\n\n---\n\n**Help Jashy by obtaining the Glowing Crystal Base - 0/1 - Hills of Shade**\n_**This step updates when you pick up a Glowing Crystal Base, a container groundspawn in the Hills of Shade, marked on **this map** \\-\\- in the undead caves in the southwestern part of the zone - the container is in the same 'room' with Bimbalicus the Soulbleeder.**_\n_**If you do not have the task Our Lost Brother - Find the Container III [quest=4367] from Jashy, you can get it by saying the keyword \"dare\". Again, while you MUST pick up the container, the sub-task itself is not required.**_\n_**You receive Glowing Crystal Base [item=70902].**_\n\n---\n\n**Help Aring by obtaining the Light Blue Crystal Base - 0/1 - Meldrath's Majestic Mansion**\n_**This step updates when you pick up a Light Blue Crystal Base, a container groundspawn in the graveyard of Meldrath's Majestic Mansion, marked on this map.**_\n_**The quickest way to get here is through the entrance from the Steam Factory. Head straight through a door, all the way down the hallway. The door at the end leads to the graveyard. As most mobs see invis and are high density, you will need either a very solid group, a small raid, or a Divine Aura cast upon you to train your way through.**_\n_**If you do not have the task Our Lost Brother - Find the Container IV [quest=4368] from Aring, you can get it by saying the keyword \"dare\". Again, while you MUST pick up the container, the sub-task itself is not required.**_\n_**You receive Light Blue Crystal Base [item=70928].**_\n\n---\n\n**Continue to help Tonas by creating the Clear Crystal**\n_**This step updates when you combine the Essence of Decay [item=70795] and Essence of Life [item=70520] in the Clear Crystal Base.**_\n_**For more details, see the sub-task Our Lost Brother - A Clear Crystal [quest=4372]. This sub-task is not technically required, and is only used to spawn the named golems involved. As they each drop six essences, you don't have to have this task as long as someone else does.**_\n_**Note: Essences can be pre-looted.**_\n_**You receive Clear Crystal [item=70791].**_\n\n---\n\n**Continue to help Vesiss by creating the Cloudy Crystal**\n_**This step updates when you combine the Essence of Water [item=71062], Essence of Thunder [item=70846], and Essence of Arcana [item=71218] in the Cloudy Crystal Base.**_\n_**For more details, see the sub-task Our Lost Brother - A Cloudy Crystal [quest=4373]. Again, this sub-task is not technically required.**_\n_**Note: Essences can be pre-looted.**_\n_**You receive Cloudy Crystal [item=71063].**_\n\n---\n\n**Continue to help Jashy by creating the Glowing Crystal**\n_**This step updates when you combine the Essence of Fire [item=71084] and Essence of Icicles [item=71083] in the Glowing Crystal Base.**_\n_**For more details, see the sub-task Our Lost Brother - A Glowing Crystal [quest=4374]. Again, this sub-task is not technically required.**_\n_**Note: Essences can be pre-looted.**_\n_**You receive Glowing Crystal [item=71086].**_\n\n---\n\n**Continue to help Aring by creating the Light Blue Crystal**\n_**This step updates when you combine the Essence of Rage [item=71054], Essence of Sadness [item=71196] and Essence of Mana [item=71195] in the Light Blue Crystal Base.**_\n_**For more details, see the sub-task Our Lost Brother - A Light Blue Crystal [quest=4375]. Again, this sub-task is not technically required.**_\n_**Note: Essences can be pre-looted.**_\n_**You receive Light Blue Crystal [item=71198].**_\n\n---\n\n**Locate Laiyken - 0/1 - Dragonscale Hills**\n_**Laiyken is located at /waypoint +1984, -1090, +362 in the Dragonscale Hills.**_\n_**Note: You must have all four crystals in the inventory to get the appropriate response. You will also receive a container, so have an empty slot ready.**_\nYou say, 'Hail, Laiyken'\nYour task 'Beyond the Barrier' has been updated.\nLaiyken says 'I see you have spoken to all of the others and now have the crystals. Place them within this container and you should have what you seek. Remember however, that as long as you are within the barrier you will need to keep the Prismatic Crystal with you. The only thing I ask of you in return is that you return to me once you have ventured past the prismatic barrier and have explored the area thoroughly.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Exploring Crystallos'.\n_**You receive Master Crystal Base [item=71036].**_\n_**Combine the four crystals in it: Clear Crystal [item=70791], Cloudy Crystal [item=71063], Glowing Crystal [item=71086], Light Blue Crystal [item=71198].**_\n_**You receive Prismatic Crystal Charm [item=71035].**_\n_**You now have access to the non-instanced 'Crystallos, Lair of the Awakened' zone. The remainder of this task is for access to the raid instance of Crystallos.**_\n_**Note: Don't delete this charm, otherwise you won't be able to complete the remainder of this task.**_\n\n---\n\n**Explore Crystallos - 0/1 - Crystallos, Lair of the Awakened**\n_**Complete the sub-task Explore Crystallos [quest=4385].**_\n\n---\n\n**Return to Laiyken with your discovery - 0/1 - Dragonscale Hills**\nYou say, 'Hail, Laiyken'\nYour task \"Beyond the Barrier\" has been updated.\nLaiyken says 'Hmm, it would seem as though he is elsewhere. By now, you must know that the four individuals you have spoken to were the warders bound to Kerafyrm. I wonder if he has found the power to phase himself from our sight. The only other way I fear we may be able to locate him is by finding a crystal shard that he lost when he first arrived. Bring this shard back to me and I should be able to fashion you a more powerful charm to locate him.\n\n---\n\n**Find the lost crystal of Kerafyrm - 0/1 - Meldrath's Majestic Mansion**\n_**An Oil Stained Crystal [item=73232] (12 pieces) can be found within the chest [npc=28067] at the end of the Mansion Event: Meldrath the Malignant [quest=4485].**_\n_**Note: Reportedly, you can enter the MMM raid zone with level 85, loot the Oil Stained Crystal and get properly flagged for Crystallos raids. The MMM raid flag itself is apparently not required for Crystallos raids, as long as you're able to loot this crystal.**_\n**A confirmation of this would be appreciated.**\n\n---\n\n**Return to Laiyken with the crystal - 0/1 - Dragonscale Hills**\nYou say, 'Hail, Laiyken'\nYour task 'Beyond the Barrier' has been updated.\nYou have helped the warders break the seal on Kerafyrm's Lair. All that is left is to face the beast.\nYou gain experience!\nLaiyken says 'You have proven to be stronger than I originally had thought.'\nLaiyken says 'Interesting. It seems as though this is not actually a crystal at all. It is a scale from Kerafyrm. He truly has grown to be very powerful. With this scale I should be able to channel my magic through it to protect you without the need of the previous charm anymore. You will also be able to see the lair of Kerafyrm. If you are [ **ready**] to venture into Kerafrym's Lair, please let me know.'\n_**You are now flagged for the Crystallos: Raid Instance [zone=573] zone.**_\n\n---\n\n_**Rewards:**_\nExperience (4-6 AA)\nAccess to Crystallos, Lair of the Awakened (Prismatic Crystal Charm)\nAccess to Crystallos: Raid Instance (Flag)\n**Submitted by:** Revamped by iventheassassin\n- Prismatic Crystal Charm [item=71035]",
