      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Dragonscale Hills [zone=539]\n**Who:**\n- Kalim`Kar the Gold [npc=26869]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 80\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Spell\n**Quest Items:**\n- Glowing Prismatic Rune [item=72020]\n- Humming Finsternacht Rune [item=71349]\n- Mechamagical Metamorpher [item=76280]\n- Whirring Clockwork Rune [item=71322]\n**Era:** | !Secrets of Faydwer\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Dec 11 21:27:02 2007\nModified: Sat May 25 08:35:22 2024 | | Kalim`Kar the Gold [npc=26869] may be found at 2300, -1640, 320. He accepts runes that drop from various SoF raids in exchange for various Rk. III spells.\nHumming Finsternacht Rune [item=71349] \\- Level 76 spells\nWhirring Clockwork Rune [item=71322] \\- Mixture of level 77 and 78 spells\nGlowing Prismatic Rune [item=72020] \\- Mixture of level 79 and 80 spells\nIf you have a Mechamagical Metamorpher [item=76280], you can downgrade a rune by combining it inside the metamorpher: Glowing Prismatic Rune to Whirring Clockwork Rune, Whirring Clockwork Rune to Humming Finsternacht Rune.\nUpon handing in a Humming Finsternacht Rune or Whirring Clockwork Rune:\nKalim'Kar the Gold breaks into a wide, foolishly elated grin, 'You've found exactly what I need! For your efforts, and by the command of Keikolin, I grant you magic of tremendous power. Use it wisely.'\n_Additionally, on handing in your final rune of any type..._\nKalim`Kar tells you, 'There are no further magics I can teach you from this type of rune.'\nThe rewards are as follows:\n**Bard:**\nHumming Finsternacht Rune\n1. Song: Elddar's Dawnsong Rk. III\n\n2. Song: Amber's Last Lullaby Rk. III\n\n3. Song: Cantata of Restoration Rk. III\n\n4. Song: Aria of the Artist Rk.